From 06eedfaaafffa72af342dbd43f772e9b35f7a8d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 08:24:38 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native V2 service and authority

Port of chronik-lib v2.rs V2Service and the Authority of v2_server.rs:
one serialized v2_index DB owner shared with readers, binding and model
checks, genesis/connect/disconnect transitions that set the index-error
flag on failure, status, bounded branch queries with the typed response
byte budget, and the authority fence (invalidate, suspend, publish,
publish with a native context stamp; observation sequence and generation
counters that never wrap). The plain ffi structs mirror v2_ffi.rs so the
host fills them without node headers in the extension.

Not ported: the tests that need the unused start_v2_server listener,
and the mutex-poisoning half of the terminal-failure test (std::mutex
has no poisoning).

Tier: V2
